1
00:00:43,210 --> 00:00:46,534
=Born Again=

2
00:00:46,534 --> 00:00:49,537
=Episode 7=

3
00:01:01,520 --> 00:01:02,520
You're awake?

4
00:01:02,520 --> 00:01:03,520
You...

5
00:01:06,840 --> 00:01:08,040
I'll make you pay back double

6
00:01:08,800 --> 00:01:10,560
for what I suffered today.

7
00:01:12,040 --> 00:01:13,640
You refused to sacrifice for art, right?

8
00:01:14,120 --> 00:01:15,120
It's okay.

9
00:01:15,760 --> 00:01:16,760
I'll help you.

10
00:01:36,720 --> 00:01:37,960
Can't take it already?

11
00:01:38,880 --> 00:01:39,880
How about this?

12
00:01:49,680 --> 00:01:50,680
Director!

13
00:01:50,680 --> 00:01:52,400
- You promised me.
- Mei, are you crazy?

14
00:01:52,400 --> 00:01:53,600
As long as Xiaotang obeys,

15
00:01:54,000 --> 00:01:55,280
you won't hurt her.

16
00:01:55,280 --> 00:01:56,840
- Let go!
- No!

17
00:01:56,840 --> 00:01:58,280
- Let go!
- No!

18
00:01:59,640 --> 00:02:01,680
Mei, are you out of your mind?

19
00:02:02,040 --> 00:02:03,040
How dare you stop me?

20
00:02:03,160 --> 00:02:04,160
What's wrong with you?

21
00:02:04,160 --> 00:02:05,800
Look at me! You want me to let her go?

22
00:02:05,800 --> 00:02:06,800
Mei!

23
00:02:08,400 --> 00:02:10,200
Mei!

24
00:02:10,200 --> 00:02:12,960
Say something. Say it.

25
00:02:12,960 --> 00:02:13,960
Mei!

26
00:02:22,080 --> 00:02:24,920
Director Li, even at this point,

27
00:02:25,320 --> 00:02:27,200
are you still going to hide the truth?

28
00:02:33,720 --> 00:02:36,920
Qiang, your wife fell ill last month.

29
00:02:36,920 --> 00:02:38,036
Can you afford her surgery?

30
00:02:38,800 --> 00:02:40,200
Director Li said

31
00:02:41,040 --> 00:02:44,440
he'd give you the marketing funds.

32
00:02:44,440 --> 00:02:45,960
Did you get that money?

33
00:02:47,280 --> 00:02:48,640
- Gu Xiaotang, what did you say?
- Director Li.

34
00:02:49,200 --> 00:02:51,280
How did she know that?

35
00:02:51,840 --> 00:02:52,840
You said that money...

36
00:02:52,840 --> 00:02:55,200
She's lying. Don't trust her.

37
00:02:55,200 --> 00:02:57,320
Right, Director Li wouldn't lie to us.

38
00:02:58,160 --> 00:02:59,160
What are you doing?

39
00:02:59,160 --> 00:03:00,160
Hu,

40
00:03:01,160 --> 00:03:02,440
why are you still defending him?

41
00:03:04,800 --> 00:03:07,328
Your brother got injured
on the construction site last year.

42
00:03:07,720 --> 00:03:09,320
Did you get the compensation?

43
00:03:11,720 --> 00:03:15,200
Director Li said
they had powerful connections

44
00:03:15,840 --> 00:03:17,280
and promised to negotiate for you.

45
00:03:18,560 --> 00:03:20,400
But if I remember correctly,

46
00:03:20,400 --> 00:03:23,400
you're getting dismissed
next week, right?

47
00:03:23,400 --> 00:03:24,680
Shut up, or you'll pay.

48
00:03:26,240 --> 00:03:28,720
If you don't trust me, check his phone.

49
00:03:29,120 --> 00:03:30,920
He's written
your dismissal letter on it.

50
00:03:30,920 --> 00:03:31,930
Let me check your phone.

51
00:03:31,930 --> 00:03:33,320
- Let me check.
- Wait, no phone on me.

52
00:03:33,320 --> 00:03:34,400
- Give me the money.
- Give it to me.

53
00:03:34,400 --> 00:03:36,240
- Let go!
- Give me the money.

54
00:03:36,240 --> 00:03:37,440
The money for my wife.

55
00:03:39,640 --> 00:03:40,640
Wait.

56
00:03:40,840 --> 00:03:42,680
- I have no phone on me.
- Give me the money.

57
00:03:42,680 --> 00:03:43,840
- What are you doing? Stop!
- Give me the money.

58
00:03:43,840 --> 00:03:45,120
Give me the money.

59
00:03:47,000 --> 00:03:48,520
Xiaotang, run!

60
00:03:49,960 --> 00:03:51,040
Where's your conscience?

61
00:03:51,040 --> 00:03:53,120
- Give me.
- She's getting away.

62
00:03:53,120 --> 00:03:54,120
Get her!

63
00:03:57,160 --> 00:03:58,160
Stop!

64
00:03:59,520 --> 00:04:01,520
Run now! Run!

65
00:04:01,920 --> 00:04:02,920
Stop!

66
00:04:04,040 --> 00:04:05,040
Go!

67
00:04:05,040 --> 00:04:06,760
Mei, just go.

68
00:04:06,760 --> 00:04:09,480
No, Xiaotang. It's all my fault.

69
00:04:09,480 --> 00:04:10,960
I'll hold them off. Don't worry.

70
00:04:10,960 --> 00:04:12,000
They won't hurt me.

71
00:04:12,200 --> 00:04:14,240
Mei!

72
00:04:16,200 --> 00:04:17,200
Mei!

73
00:04:20,040 --> 00:04:21,040
How dare you!

74
00:04:22,000 --> 00:04:23,000
Mei!

75
00:04:37,360 --> 00:04:39,600
(Is everything going
to start all over again?)

76
00:04:58,680 --> 00:04:59,920
Back up now!

77
00:05:15,520 --> 00:05:16,520
What about Mei?

78
00:05:16,520 --> 00:05:17,520
Let's get out first.

79
00:05:30,440 --> 00:05:31,680
You remember the loop thing?

80
00:05:33,400 --> 00:05:34,400
No.

81
00:05:34,960 --> 00:05:35,960
Then why are you here?

82
00:05:35,960 --> 00:05:37,440
I saw you touching your ear.

83
00:05:37,720 --> 00:05:40,160
I remember you only do that
when you're upset.

84
00:05:40,920 --> 00:05:41,920
I...

85
00:05:44,320 --> 00:05:45,920
Since you were Xiaotang's classmate,

86
00:05:45,920 --> 00:05:47,280
why not come work for me?

87
00:05:47,280 --> 00:05:50,360
Xiaotang is always good to her friends.

88
00:05:55,560 --> 00:05:58,080
Can you tell me more about
what you mentioned today?

89
00:05:58,680 --> 00:05:59,680
About what?

90
00:06:00,440 --> 00:06:01,480
The loop.

91
00:06:07,840 --> 00:06:10,240
So, that's pretty much
how the loop works.

92
00:06:10,680 --> 00:06:11,680
Did I talk too fast?

93
00:06:12,280 --> 00:06:13,280
Did you get it?

94
00:06:13,280 --> 00:06:14,280
Yes.

95
00:06:15,000 --> 00:06:18,040
So if it weren't for the loop,

96
00:06:18,240 --> 00:06:19,440
you wouldn't even remember me.

97
00:06:22,960 --> 00:06:25,360
I remember you. You're Ye Shen.

98
00:06:26,600 --> 00:06:27,600
That's not the point.

99
00:06:27,600 --> 00:06:31,200
The point is,
the loop reset earlier this time.

100
00:06:31,200 --> 00:06:33,320
That means, many things
would happen all over again.

101
00:06:33,320 --> 00:06:35,080
If what you said is true,

102
00:06:35,080 --> 00:06:36,720
and everything
will happen all over again,

103
00:06:36,920 --> 00:06:38,560
we have to do something to stop it.

104
00:06:47,480 --> 00:06:48,760
I can't drag you into this.

105
00:06:48,760 --> 00:06:50,160
This has nothing to do with you.

106
00:06:51,880 --> 00:06:53,080
I can handle it on my own.

107
00:06:53,080 --> 00:06:55,640
Didn't you say we're allies?

108
00:06:57,520 --> 00:07:00,160
Since we're allies,
and this isn't over yet,

109
00:07:00,880 --> 00:07:02,000
we

110
00:07:03,360 --> 00:07:04,600
can keep going.

111
00:07:17,240 --> 00:07:20,480
Xiaotang, I have a new T-shirt for you.

112
00:07:20,960 --> 00:07:22,320
It might not fit you well.

113
00:07:22,320 --> 00:07:23,520
I'll put it right here.

114
00:07:26,200 --> 00:07:27,200
Give it to me.

115
00:07:33,080 --> 00:07:35,400
Then I'll step out.

116
00:07:35,400 --> 00:07:37,280
Wait, could you help dry my hair?

117
00:07:37,640 --> 00:07:38,920
My arm got hurt.

118
00:07:39,320 --> 00:07:40,360
I can't lift it up.

119
00:07:42,080 --> 00:07:43,080
Me?

120
00:07:44,680 --> 00:07:45,680
Okay.

121
00:08:26,240 --> 00:08:27,240
Done.

122
00:08:28,080 --> 00:08:29,840
I'll go back now.

123
00:08:39,640 --> 00:08:40,640
Wait.

124
00:08:51,280 --> 00:08:52,280
Your

125
00:08:53,320 --> 00:08:54,320
heart is beating fast.

126
00:08:55,640 --> 00:08:56,640
Are you okay?

127
00:09:04,560 --> 00:09:05,560
Are you scared of me?

128
00:09:05,560 --> 00:09:08,280
I-I'm not.

129
00:09:11,520 --> 00:09:13,480
Do you know that in the last loop,

130
00:09:13,880 --> 00:09:16,360
we were way closer than this?

131
00:09:17,000 --> 00:09:18,000
Really?

132
00:09:18,000 --> 00:09:19,600
Why would I lie to you?

133
00:09:19,600 --> 00:09:21,040
In the last loop,

134
00:09:21,040 --> 00:09:22,760
we fought side by side.

135
00:09:23,080 --> 00:09:24,080
And...

136
00:09:24,960 --> 00:09:27,080
We even kissed.

137
00:09:30,120 --> 00:09:31,800
Were you dreaming?

138
00:09:31,800 --> 00:09:32,800
You don't believe it?

139
00:09:37,280 --> 00:09:39,480
Am I the only one who remembers that?

140
00:09:40,200 --> 00:09:42,480
Was it really not a dream?

141
00:09:48,120 --> 00:09:51,160
Then tell me if this is a dream.

142
00:10:43,698 --> 00:10:47,054
♪The face deep in the heart♪

143
00:10:47,246 --> 00:10:49,708
♪Suddenly clear and hazy♪

144
00:10:51,083 --> 00:10:54,783
♪Across time and space, eyes meet again♪

145
00:10:54,994 --> 00:10:57,434
♪Deeply trapped in the vortex♪

146
00:10:57,581 --> 00:10:59,953
♪Searching for familiar outlines♪

147
00:11:00,103 --> 00:11:02,860
♪Persistently guarding,
endlessly cycling♪

148
00:11:02,860 --> 00:11:05,181
♪Even for just a second♪

149
00:11:06,526 --> 00:11:09,989
♪If raindrops flow backward
into the sky♪

150
00:11:10,117 --> 00:11:11,966
♪And sunlight reverses♪

151
00:11:11,966 --> 00:11:15,436
♪As the sun rises and sets,
we reunite with yesterday♪

152
00:11:15,792 --> 00:11:17,866
♪I'll build a dream with you♪

153
00:11:18,368 --> 00:11:21,777
♪Upon the ruins, spring breeze arrives♪

154
00:11:22,034 --> 00:11:27,246
♪Even if there's no end,
I won't regret the start♪

155
00:11:28,500 --> 00:11:31,065
♪Eternity like a day, rushing to you♪

156
00:11:31,107 --> 00:11:34,560
♪You don't need to recognize my eyes♪

157
00:11:35,137 --> 00:11:38,100
♪Following the tracks
of the days that were♪

158
00:11:38,845 --> 00:11:41,453
♪A day like a lifetime, rushing to you♪

159
00:11:41,453 --> 00:11:45,076
♪You don't need to remember my name♪

160
00:11:45,546 --> 00:11:49,602
♪I'll be the dawn you haven't seen♪
